Online:Veterancy:
{{Incomplete}}{{Trail|Alliance War}}
'''Veterancy''' is a reward system for the [[Online:PvP|PvP]] modes in [[ON:Elder Scrolls Online|Elder Scrolls Online]] that was introduced towards the end of [[ON:Season Zero|Season Zero]] with [[ON:Update 50|Update 50]]. It has unique cosmetics, titles, [[Online:Vengeance Perks|perks]] for the [[Online:Vengeance|Vengeance]] Campaign in [[ON:Cyrodiil|Cyrodiil]]. Veterancy has 100 Ranks, at Rank 50 and beyond, you can earn permanent titles. Once you reach rank 100, you will start earning progress for a repeatable reward.

While in Veterancy zones, the HUD will display your temporary seasonal title, where the CP level is normally displayed. Each Veterancy Season will last for approximately 6 months. Progress through the Veterancy ranks can be achieved by earning XP and [[Online:Alliance Points|Alliance Points]] from participating in Cyrodiil [[Online:Campaigns|Campaigns]], [[ON:Imperial City|Imperial City]] and [[ON:Battlegrounds|Battlegrounds]]. This include completing daily quests in these areas.

See below for the current Veterancy Season's rewards.{{TOCright}}

