Online:Black-Tongue Tribe:
{{Mod Header|Murkmire}}
<noinclude>{{Trail|Factions}}
:''"We honor Sithis above all else. Raj-Sithis the Changer—not the Destroyer from the [[Lore:Duskfall|dusk]] times—but ends are often beginnings.<br>There are no purer agents of change than Shadowscales, so we prepare our children from birth to learn their secrets."'' —Waku-Mat</noinclude>
The [[ON:Black-Tongue Tribe|Black-Tongue Tribe]], or '''Kota-Vimleel''' in [[Lore:Jel|Jel]], is an [[ON:Argonian|Argonian]] tribe residing within [[Online:Murkmire|Murkmire]]. They live in the dark and shadowy corners of the mire, but do not share the same negative reputation as the similar [[ON:Ghost People Tribe|Ghost People Tribe]].<noinclude> They tend to be soft-spoken unless caught off-guard, wherein they will not hesitate to kill those who trespass upon their lands. 

The tribe is dedicated to [[Lore:Sithis|Sithis]], and has been known to actively attempt to influence their clutches to produce many [[Online:Shadowscales|Shadowscales]].  The tribe consists of a good deal of alchemists, who use their vast knowledge of the plants of [[ON:Black Marsh|Black Marsh]] to produce a powerful contraceptive known as "Gloom Nectar", which allows the Black-Tongues to synchronize their egg-laying cycles and ensure that many of their clutches are born under the sign of the [[Lore:The Shadow|Shadow]].

