{{Online Items}}

Online:Hireling Chests:
{{trail|Items}} {{deprecated|[[Online:Patch/1.1.2|Patch 1.1.2]]}}
[[Online:Hireling|Hirelings]] originally sent loot boxes via mail, which could then be opened to obtain the crafting materials. They were removed in [[Online:Patch/1.1.2|Patch 1.1.2]] to ensure that the raw materials received were appropriate for the character's level. However, unopened chests were not removed from inventories and can therefore still be seen in-game.

