Online:Runestones:
{{Trail|Items}}
[[File:ON-item-Runestones.jpg|thumb|right|The three types of Runestone: Potency, Essence, and Aspect]]This is a list of the various '''Runestones''' in the game. There are three kinds of Runestones: [[#Potency Runes|Potency Runes]], [[#Essence Runes|Essence Runes]], and [[#Aspect Runes|Aspect Runes]]. The type of runestone can be readily determined by its shape and color. Potency Runes are blue and square, Essence Runes are yellow/green and hexagonal, and Aspect Runes are red and circular.

Runestones are used to craft [[ON:Glyphs|Glyphs]], which can in turn be used to [[Online:Enchanting|enchant]] armor, weapons, or jewelry. Each Glyph must contain one of each type.

You can get runestones from runestone [[ON:Nodes|nodes]], by extracting them from Glyphs, or by receiving them from your [[Online:Enchanting#Passive Abilities|hireling]]. The potency runes that can be extracted are determined by [[Online:Leveling|character level]], or [[Online:Champion Points|Champion Points]] above level 50, and [[ON:Potency Improvement|Potency Improvement]] skill level. Essence runes and Aspect runes are random, and the highest quality Aspect runes may be found even at low levels.

