{{Trail|Items}}
'''Trash''' are items found while adventuring (typically by killing certain types of creatures) whose sole purpose is to be sold to [[Online:Vendors|vendors]] for gold. They all bear the same description: "Sell to a merchant for gold." Loot items are leveled, so items of the same name but with different value may be found in different zones. Only items with the same type and level will stack, so remember to sell off these items or they will fill up your inventory over time.

