The population of the proud feline '''Khajiit''' (listen <ab>LO-audio-word-Khajiit.ogg</ab>) has dwindled in recent years following a devastating outbreak of Knahaten Flu. They owe a great debt to Ayrenn, Queen of the High Elves, for her help in restoring order from the chaos that followed the plague. They have a wry wit and a hedonistic outlook, but they are fearsome on the field of battle. They are the strong arm of the Aldmeri Dominion. {{FMI}}

There are many breeds of Khajiit including the '''Cathay''', [[ON:Alfiq|Alfiq]], [[ON:Cathay-raht|Cathay-raht]], [[ON:Dagi|Dagi]], [[ON:Dagi-raht|Dagi-raht]], [[ON:Pahmar|Pahmar]], [[ON:Pahmar-raht|Pahmar-raht]], and [[ON:Senche-raht|Senche-raht]].
