'''Bracing''' was a skill in the [[Online:Heavy Armor|Heavy Armor]] skill line which reduced the [[ON:Stamina|Stamina]] cost of blocking by 10% at Rank I and 20% at Rank II, if you were wearing five or more pieces of Heavy Armor. The passive was removed in Update 10 and replaced with [[Online:Wrath|Wrath]].

==Patch Notes==
{{ESO Patch Note|2.4.5|* Renamed this passive ability to [[ON:Wrath|Wrath]].
* Redesigned this passive ability so it now increases your Weapon and Spell Damage by 10/20 for 6 seconds after taking damage at Ranks I/II respectively, stacking up to 10 times.}}

